      "id": "3e9fa13c-4379-4ea5-88eb-220e25a49928",
      "name": "Note 60fa98",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## YKW 02 v2: Abandoned checkout\nThe storefront team's scenario, without the 15-minute Postgres scan:\n\n- **RabbitMQ** `q.n8n.checkout-abandoned`: the storefront publishes `payment.abandoned` when Paystack still shows nothing paid after the window (RabbitMQ timers re-check every 2 min). Each checkout has its own timer; nothing scans.\n- **Send window 15:00–21:00** Nairobi, when people unwind and watch; outside it, held until 15:00.\n- Skip if paid since, owned, or no phone.\n- **The recommender** picks the closest film to the cart; bundle at 20% off (10% off the cart film alone without a pick). The **storefront prices it** and signs the link (1 h).\n- **AI copy** from facts only, checked by code; template if it fails.\n\nPaying through the link credits *KES recovered · A*.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 400,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
